advanced-contract	Run Legacy live compatibility report and lineage floor	2026-10-05T11:33:53.0347672Z             "section": "DocAtlas > What DocAtlas is and what problem it solves",
advanced-contract	Run Legacy live compatibility report and lineage floor	2026-10-05T11:33:53.0348740Z             "snippet": "Local-first documentation context remains the runtime foundation: DocAtlas solves the problem of coding agents guessing from stale or generic documentation. It turns reviewable project docs, lockfiles, and approved dependency documentation into compact, source-attributed evidence for coding agents. It keeps authority, scope, and version binding explicit and fails closed when mandatory evidence is unavailable. Its default MCP surface is deliberately small so agents select the correct operation reliably.",
