advanced-contract	Run Legacy live compatibility report and lineage floor	2026-10-05T11:33:53.0792748Z             "snippet": "`doc-atlas clear-index` removes derived index state while preserving project\nsources, `docatlas.yaml`, configuration, and unrelated files; it never\nsilently widens the cleanup scope. The command is preview-only\nunless `--apply` is supplied.",
