advanced-contract	Run Legacy live compatibility report and lineage floor	2026-10-05T11:33:53.0999331Z             "snippet": "The project answer contract requires explicit proof obligations for each supported user question before evidence can authorize an answer. A retrieval hit alone is never proof: evidence selection requires locally bound subject/relation/value evidence for every mandatory facet, and complete exact proof outranks compact generic text. Questions whose subject or requested operation cannot be resolved fail closed instead of using a synthetic `project` or `requested operation` subject.\nEvidence selection chooses candidates by requiring locally bound subject, relation, and value proof for every mandatory facet; complete exact proof outranks compact generic text.",
